     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Your Defensive Toolkit",
     "content": "Write a personal defensive document. Three columns. Column 1: the five Greene laws you have most often encountered, with a brief description from your own life. Column 2: how you will recognize the law in real time next time (specific signals). Column 3: your prepared response (leave, decline, name, refuse to reciprocate). Keep this document; review it quarterly. Defensive literacy depends on rehearsed responses.",
